
<p>Anne Applebaum, <a href="https://www.theatlantic.com/ideas/2026/03/trump-iran-war-allies/686423/?gift=aQyUJR7AIw1mJWdQ6Ed6yGfvOucd9Oa8W54yMDTtr2I">writing for The Atlantic</a> (gift link):</p>

<blockquote>
  <p>Specifically, they remember that for 14 months, the American
president has tariffed them, mocked their security concerns, and
repeatedly insulted them. As long ago as January 2020, Trump
<a href="https://www.reuters.com/world/we-will-never-help-europe-under-attack-eu-official-cites-trump-saying-2024-01-10/">told</a> several European officials that “if Europe is under
attack, we will never come to help you and to support you.” In
February 2025, he <a href="https://www.pbs.org/newshour/politics/what-trump-and-zelenskyy-said-during-their-heated-argument-in-the-oval-office">told</a> Ukrainian President Volodymyr
